          en: 'This article complements the previous one on how to study, adding the dimension of where and with what resources. The next article, "How to Build a Realistic Study Plan," transforms these principles into a practical tool. "Why Copying Tutorials Won\'t Transform You" specifically addresses the risk of online courses when used passively. The articles on documentation and research reinforce the skills that the self-taught developer needs to master and that complement any chosen education modality.',
