          en: 'To deepen this reflection, talk to professionals who followed each of the paths and ask for honest accounts about advantages and regrets. Analyze the real requirements of the positions you aspire to: do they formally require a degree? Research the curriculum of colleges in your region and compare with the topics you need to master. Evaluate online courses by reading reviews from people who completed them and are working in the field — not from those who just finished the course. For the self-taught path, build a curated list of high-quality resources and follow the conceptual progression this trail proposes, complementing with materials that deepen each specific topic.',
