          en: 'This article directly complements the three previous ones on learning methodology. The ability to study without depending on tutorials is one of the core competencies Block 2 seeks to develop. The next articles on documentation and research expand the alternatives to tutorials: how to use official documentation as a primary learning resource and how to search efficiently when needing to solve a specific problem. Together, these articles replace tutorial dependency with a professional autonomous learning toolkit.',
