          en: 'This article is the penultimate of Block 2, focused on learning methodology. The next article, "Learning to Search Is a Mandatory Skill," directly complements: while this one addresses the primary source (documentation), the next addresses how to find information when documentation is not enough. Together, these two articles form the pair of competencies that replaces tutorial dependency with complete professional autonomy.',
